# {{NAME}}

Local Stagepass project for Webflow.

## Setup

```bash
npm install
npm run build
stagepass link {{NAME}} --origin my-project.webflow.io
```

Activate on your live site: `https://my-project.webflow.io/?stagepass={{NAME}}.sp`

## Scripts

| Script | Description |
| :--- | :--- |
| `npm run build` | Bundle JS/CSS into `dist/` with content hashes + `manifest.json` |
| `npm run watch` | Rebuild on change |

## Webflow Custom Code

Prefer the major CDN pin `@2`. An exact pin is optional (see `data-stagepass-version`).

### Head

```html
{{HEAD_SNIPPET}}
```

Optional exact pin (replace `@2` in the URL if you need a locked version): `@{{LOADER_VERSION}}`.

### Footer

```html
{{FOOTER_SNIPPET}}
```

After each production upload, set `data-src` / `data-href` to your hosted URLs. For content-hashed uploads, read the filenames from `dist/manifest.json`. Local Stagepass swapping can keep using the stable `dist/main.js` and `dist/styles.css` copies.

## PHP

PHP helpers for this scaffolder are planned for a later Stagepass release. Linked `.sp` sites can still use PHP via the CLI when PHP is installed system-wide.
